'''Silver Candy''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player finishing '''2nd''' on the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]] Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Silver Candy has the same appearance as [[Candy]], but the red color is replaced with a silver, giving it a monochrome look.

== Trivia ==
*During the event, players could collect as many [[Snow Tokens|Winter Tokens]] (acts exactly like [[coins]] but Christmas-exclusive) and score points which will determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Candy]], [[Blue Candy]], and [[Gold Candy]].
**The trophy reskins were awarded 2 years after the original [[Candy]] was added to the game.
*This item is a silver reskin of Candy, a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this weapon is [https://www.roblox.com/users/446482324/profile '''Luna_Bella4'''] (also known as DreamfulBella). 

